feather-chevron-up" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:R1i32:"><div data-rid="acbd3021-f6a6-4784-bd9d-55768b24e9c1" class="r-1iawy8i"><div data-rid="dfac95e9-42ce-4d90-8cdc-c83619550c4c" class="r-7jogik alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Skinny Cleanse provides a concentrated intake of cold-pressed fruit and vegetable blends that are packed with vitamins, minerals, enzymes, antioxidants, and anti-inflammatory compounds.</p></span></div><div data-rid="a13b7f05-8f66-46e4-b5a6-4eec42ee508c" class="r-ieemjx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>When your body gets the nutrients it’s missing, it stops holding onto excess weight and body fat - making it easier to lose pounds and inches.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f710e3a2-0e47-4e4c-8c6c-494a6791c7fc" class="r-1ro1ftt" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="78c5f154-b21c-491c-81b7-be6b2a65f596" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2i32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1hsqkha"><div data-rid="2bdf58ff-93e7-4112-adb9-4f5d2b55d107" class="r-z9ub6l alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>02</p></span></div><div data-rid="9875bbee-fe7d-4638-8f51-aee48cd27fb6" class="r-1s8mzna alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Reset your diet and break unhealthy cravings</p></span></div><div data-rid="24057880-c80b-462b-ae42-b9baa74896b0" class="r-1xbxopy" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline point